        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of Manila, capture of the Japanese 20mm Cannon Blockhouse\n- Countries: Japan\n\nFacts:\n- The capture of the Japanese 20mm Cannon Blockhouse occurred in the early stages of a battle or engagement.\n- Japanese forces fought in the engagement in which the Japanese 20mm Cannon Blockhouse was captured.\n- Japanese forces also fought in the Battle of Manila.\n- The engagement in which the Japanese 20mm Cannon Blockhouse was captured and the Battle of Manila were fought by forces from the same country, Japan.",
